      "note": "the first card is tall (4:5 image), the rest short. Two things the source section carries that the pattern does not: (1) the filter chips (All · Factories · Infrastructure · M&E) — `fields.filters` — are <span>s with a hover and no handler in the source, so the pattern renders none rather than a fake control (accepted gap G-W7; a real filter needs a type per card and a script, a link chip has no destination); (2) the first card's own \"Read the case study →\" reaches the spec as a second section cta (`fields.ctas[1]`) and renderTypedSection clones it into the header row next to \"All projects →\" — a cta whose text is a card link's label is that card's link, and the seeder must drop it the way it drops a cta equal to an item's title"
    },
