          "note": "the inner-page splits whose picture FOLLOWS the copy in the source (about hero, Where we work, Safety, careers hero and Life on our sites, project detail). Named one by one: the projects page's flagship section (projects-*-3) is picture-first and a view-only match used to flip it; the front page's Why Northgate keeps the illustration first with no style"
